│    - SELL legs (center): get SL (buy trigger when price rises) + TP (buy     │
│  limit when price falls)                                                     │
│    - BUY legs (hedges): get NO orders — held to expiry                       │
│    - SL = entry_premium × (1 + sl_pct). TP = entry_premium × (1 - tp_pct)    │
