│  ## 10. RECOMMENDATIONS FOR 2026-05-23                                       │
│                                                                              │
│  ### A. ENTRY GATE ENFORCEMENT 🔴 HIGHEST PRIORITY                           │
│  | Rule | Details |                                                          │
│  |---|---|                                                                   │
│  | **HARD BLOCK** | If entry_gate_signal = "UNKNOWN" AND entry_confidence =  │
│  0 → **BLOCK trade**. No exceptions. |                                       │
│  | **Authority** | Only Entry Gate Agent can authorize a trade. Regime       │
│  Agent's "enter" recommendation ≠ override. |                                │
│  | **Override** | Require manual confirmation flag (`override=true`) to      │
│  proceed with UNKNOWN gate signal. |                                         │
│  | **Warning Log** | If NOT_UP/NOT_DOWN ≥ 65% AND gate returns UNKNOWN →     │
│  log warning but DO NOT execute. |                                           │
│                                                                              │
│  ### B. CONFIDENCE THRESHOLDS                                                │
│  | Current | Proposed | Rationale |                                          │
│  |---|---|---|                                                               │
│  | NOT_UP min: 60% | **65%** | 60% is barely above noise level |             │
│  | No time adjustment | **+5 after 11:00** | Later entries need stronger     │
│  conviction |                                                                │
│  | 60-64% allowed | **BORDERLINE queue** | Requires additional validation |  │
│                                                                              │
