│  | VIX Range | SL_PCT | Buffer (pts at ₹137 fill) | Rationale |              │
│  |---|---|---|---|                                                           │
│  | < 15 | 0.30 | ₹41.10 | Low vol = less noise |                             │
│  | 15-18 | 0.35 | ₹48.07 | Current default |                                 │
│  | **18-20** | **0.40** ← CHANGE | **₹55.04** | More buffer for elevated     │
│  vol |                                                                       │
│  | > 20 | **DO NOT ENTER** | — | Vol too high, theta unreliable |            │
│                                                                              │
│  ### D. TP_PCT BY DTE (Days To Expiry) 🔄 CHANGE                             │
│  | DTE | TP_PCT | Decay Target | Rationale |                                 │
│  |---|---|---|---|                                                           │
│  | 4+ | **0.40** | 40% decay (TP at ₹82.41) | Achievable in 1-2 days |       │
│  | 2-3 | **0.30** | 30% decay | Tighter due to gamma risk |                  │
│  | 0-1 | **0.20** | 20% decay | Quick exit, high gamma |                     │
│  | Current: 0.55 | Too aggressive | TP at ₹61.81 (55% decay) | Unrealistic   │
│  for same-day |                                                              │
│                                                                              │
