│  - **Fix Option B:** Keep wing_width=200, require net_credit ≥ ₹86 → R:R =   │
│  86/114 = 0.75 ✅                                                            │
│  - **Fix Option C:** Target wing selection that yields credit ≥ 41% of wing  │
│  width                                                                       │
