│  ## 9. WHAT FAILED / CRITICAL CONCERNS ❌                                    │
│                                                                              │
│  ### ❌ ENTRY GATE VIOLATION (#1 PRIORITY — CRITICAL BUG)                    │
│  - **entry_gate_signal="UNKNOWN"**, **entry_confidence=0**, yet trade was    │
│  EXECUTED                                                                    │
│  - NOT_UP at 60% should NOT override the Entry Gate                          │
│  - Regime Agent's "enter" recommendation overrode Gate's rejection           │
│  - **No validation check exists**: "If gate says UNKNOWN, block trade"       │
│  - This is a **SYSTEM BUG in agent priority hierarchy**                      │
│                                                                              │
│  ### ❌ WEAK SIGNAL CONFIDENCE                                               │
│  - NOT_UP at 60% is barely above 50% threshold — **weak conviction**         │
│  - No confidence > 65% existed for any signal                                │
│  - entry_confidence=0 means the system itself rated confidence at zero       │
│                                                                              │
│  ### ❌ R:R RATIO SUBOPTIMAL                                                 │
│  - **0.63:1** — risk ₹1.22 to make ₹0.77                                     │
│  - Below recommended **0.70 minimum** for credit spreads                     │
│  - Structural issue: wing_width=200 with net_credit=₹77.35                   │
│                                                                              │
│  ### ❌ SL TOO TIGHT FOR VIX 18.39                                           │
│  - sl_pct=0.35 provides only **₹48.07 buffer**                               │
│  - At VIX 18.39, daily premium swings of 35-40% are common                   │
│  - A VIX spike + small adverse spot move can trigger **premature SL**        │
│  - 0.50% spot move (120 pts) is insufficient buffer for 4-DTE options        │
│                                                                              │
│  ### ❌ TP TOO AGGRESSIVE FOR SAME-DAY                                       │
│  - tp_pct=0.55 requires 55% decay (₹75.54) from ₹137.35 entry                │
│  - Same-day theta decay at 4-DTE, VIX 18.39: only **₹5-10 (3-7%)**           │
│  - TP unrealistic for same-day exit — encourages holding overnight           │
│                                                                              │
│  ### ❌ INCOMPLETE EXIT DATA (DATA INTEGRITY FAILURE)                        │
│  - exit_time, exit_reason, final_pnl **ALL truncated**                       │
│  - Cannot perform full PnL attribution or assess SL/TP hits                  │
