│  ## 10. SPECIFIC RECOMMENDATIONS FOR 20260523                                │
│                                                                              │
│  ### A. ENTRY GATE ENFORCEMENT 🔴 HIGHEST PRIORITY — HARD BLOCK              │
│                                                                              │
│  **Rule**: If `entry_gate_signal = "UNKNOWN"` AND `entry_confidence = 0` →   │
│  **HARD BLOCK. NO EXECUTION.**                                               │
│                                                                              │
│  - Only Entry Gate Agent can authorize trade — **NOT** Regime Agent's        │
│  recommendation alone                                                        │
│  - If NOT_UP/NOT_DOWN confidence ≥ 65% AND Gate returns UNKNOWN → log        │
│  warning but **DO NOT execute**                                              │
│  - Add manual override flag (`override=true` in config) for exceptional      │
│  circumstances only                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│  ### B. CONFIDENCE THRESHOLDS 🟠 RAISE MINIMUM                               │
│                                                                              │
│  | Current | Proposed | Rationale |                                          │
│  |---|---|---|                                                               │
│  | Minimum confidence: **60** | **65** | 60% is barely above random |        │
│  | entry_confidence=0 | **HARD BLOCK** | Gate's verdict is final |           │
│  | After 11:00 entry | +5 pts higher | Less time for theta decay |           │
│                                                                              │
│  ### C. SL_PCT ADJUSTMENT BY VIX TIER 🔴 CHANGE PARAMETER                    │
│                                                                              │
│  | VIX Range | Current sl_pct | Proposed sl_pct | Buffer |                   │
│  |---|---|---|---|                                                           │
│  | < 15 | 0.35 | **0.30** (tight) | ₹41 |                                    │
│  | 15-18 | 0.35 | **0.35** (keep) | ₹48 |                                    │
│  | **18-20** | **0.35** | **→ 0.40** 🔄 | **₹55** |                          │
│  | > 20 | 0.35 | **DO NOT ENTER** | — |                                      │
│                                                                              │
│  **Rationale**: At VIX 18.39, a 35% buffer (₹48) is too tight. 40% (₹55      │
│  buffer) gives 15% more breathing room to avoid premature SL on VIX noise.   │
│                                                                              │
│  ### D. TP_PCT ADJUSTMENT BY DTE 🔴 CHANGE PARAMETER                         │
│                                                                              │
│  | DTE Range | Current tp_pct | Proposed tp_pct | Decay Target |             │
│  |---|---|---|---|                                                           │
│  | **4+ DTE** | **0.55** | **→ 0.40** 🔄 | 40% (₹54.94 decay) |              │
│  | 2-3 DTE | 0.55 | **0.30** | 30% (₹41.21 decay) |                          │
│  | 0-1 DTE | 0.55 | **0.20** | 20% (₹27.47 decay) |                          │
│                                                                              │
│  **Example for today**: 4 DTE → tp_pct=0.40, TP at ₹137.35×0.60 =            │
│  **₹82.41**                                                                  │
│  - Requires ₹54.94 decay instead of ₹75.54 — **27% more achievable**         │
│                                                                              │
│  ### E. R:R RATIO FILTER 🟠 NEW HARD FLOOR                                   │
│                                                                              │
│  **Add**: `max_gain / max_loss ≥ 0.70`                                       │
│                                                                              │
│  Today's trade: 77.35/122.65 = **0.63 — FAILS**                              │
│                                                                              │
│  **Solutions**:                                                              │
│  1. **wing_width=180**, net_credit ≥ ₹75 → R:R = 75/105 = **0.71** ✅        │
│  2. **wing_width=200**, require net_credit ≥ ₹86 → R:R = 86/114 = **0.75**   │
│  ✅                                                                          │
│  3. Optimize strike selection for better credit-to-wing ratio                │
│                                                                              │
│  ### F. TRAILING STOP LOSS IMPLEMENTATION 🟠 NEW FEATURE                     │
│                                                                              │
│  For **sideways regimes** (ADX < 20), add TSL on short leg:                  │
│                                                                              │
│  | Time | Condition | Action |                                               │
│  |---|---|---|                                                               │
│  | Entry | - | Fixed SL at 35-40% above fill |                               │
